<p>Now, I could wait until somebody mentions her character&#8217;s name, and then look it up in <a href="https://github.com/larsmagne/imdb.el" data-cached-time="2025-09-21T02:15:38" data-cached-image="https://lars.ingebrigtsen.no/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/cache-2025-09-21-web.webp" onmouseenter="hoverLink(event)">imdb-mode</a>:</p>
